            <title>[LU-21081] sanity-quota test_63: granted 20480 &gt; 9216 after cleanup on ZFS</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21081</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;sanity-quota test_63 (test_dom) fails on ZFS with:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;  FAIL: granted 20480 &amp;gt; 9216 after cleanup&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;raised by wait_quota_released() via wait_quota_release_zfs() (sanity-quota.sh test_dom), the quota-release wait added by &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17077" title="sanity-quota test_63: @@@@@@ FAIL: write failed, expect succeed" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-17077"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-17077&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (commit 4a930dda75). After the DoM test files are deleted and the ZFS destroys complete, the summed MDT+OST bhardlimit grant for quota_usr stays at 20480 and never drops to the 9216 maximum within the wait period.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Seen twice, with identical numbers, in the last 30 days:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class="alternate" type="square"&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;lustre-master full-dne-zfs-part-2 (el10.1), 2026-10-29, build 4767: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/0d9c1b70-70fa-4ebc-a931-52d39d91bf41" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/0d9c1b70-70fa-4ebc-a931-52d39d91bf41&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;lustre-reviews review-dne-zfs-part-4 (el10.1), 2026-10-30, change 67603 ps11 build 134758: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/f639bb46-0fa0-433d-bd2c-2f13f7d75963" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/f639bb46-0fa0-433d-bd2c-2f13f7d75963&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;The master hit shows it is not caused by change 67603 (an mdd/connect-flag patch with no quota code). Rate is low: about 0.2% of lustre-master suite runs, and test_63 fails 1.3% in this review group overall, almost all with other errors.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Not &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17077" title="sanity-quota test_63: @@@@@@ FAIL: write failed, expect succeed" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-17077"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-17077&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ("write failed, expect succeed") and not &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21011" title="sanity-quota test_63: Timeout occurred, last suite running was sanity-quota" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-21011"&gt;LU-21011&lt;/a&gt; (sanity-quota timeout). Either quota grant is not being released on the slave after DoM deletes on ZFS, or the 9216 limit in the wait is too tight.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Raised by Patch Watcher run pw-engineer-67603-ps11-43c58bed316a on &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/67603" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/67603&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
